{"id": "EUVD-2026-92122", "enisaUuid": "1abef4d4-7691-3a0e-b71f-a89b6a74d7d2", "description": "Mammoth.js 1.3.0 before 1.12.3 contains a regular expression denial of service vulnerability in the style map tokeniser in lib/styles/parser/tokeniser.js due to overlapping regex alternatives. Attackers can supply a crafted .docx with an unterminated quoted string of repeated backslash escapes in mammoth/style-map to block the Node.js event loop.", "datePublished": "2026-10-04T17:09:54", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-05T14:55:01", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/mwilliamson/mammoth.js/issues/487", "https://github.com/mwilliamson/mammoth.js/commit/dc49225425c2c07de0a6dc3529f2386c82a032b4", "https://github.com/mwilliamson/mammoth.js/blob/1.12.2/lib/styles/parser/tokeniser.js#L6-L30", "https://github.com/mwilliamson/mammoth.js", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/mammoth-js-1.3.0-before-1.12.3-redos-via-style-map-tokeniser"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-105219", "GHSA-fp33-4hh4-xjj5"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.36, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "b34b17b9-f02c-38aa-afff-bc19ac1cdf57", "product": {"name": "mammoth.js", "vendor": {"name": "mwilliamson"}}, "product_version": "1.3.0 <1.12.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "0f88d223-e021-3061-ab63-e29b96b15c30", "vendor": {"name": "mwilliamson"}}], "isExploited": false}